WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.162 --> 00:00:03.002
-Guys, lately, everyone's
been talking about NFTs,

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:05.171
or non-fungible tokens,

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:08.807
which are popular,
a form of crypto art.

00:00:08.807 --> 00:00:10.743
But NFTs can be
pretty confusing,

00:00:10.743 --> 00:00:12.345
and there's a lot of
misinformation out there,

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.080
so I wanted to clear
some things up.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.915
It is time for
"Fact Versus Fiction."

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:17.050
-Oh.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.517
-♪ Fact ♪

00:00:18.517 --> 00:00:22.956
♪ Fact or fiction ♪

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:25.057
-Let's get started.
First up, fact,

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:28.161
NFT artwork is
impossible to forge.

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:29.895
Fiction, but like the Mona Lisa,

00:00:29.895 --> 00:00:31.730
all you really need
is a selfie with it.

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:34.700
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.169
Here's another one. Fact,

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:39.071
Beeple is one of
the biggest NFT artists.

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:41.708
Fiction, the other Teletubbies
are very jealous.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.309
-Oh.
-Is Beeple one?

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:44.844
-Beeple.

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:47.680
-Next up we have, fact,
NFTs are the latest

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:50.650
Ethereum-powered
cryptocurrency craze.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.885
Fiction, if you repeat that
sentence to your grandfather,

00:00:52.885 --> 00:00:54.553
his head will explode.

00:00:54.553 --> 00:00:56.256
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:58.124
-I don't know if that's fiction.

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.559
-Here's one, fact,

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:04.164
the total volume of all traded
NFTs is around $431 million.

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:05.397
-Ooh.

00:01:05.397 --> 00:01:07.900
-Fiction, 95% of that
went to the top seller,

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:09.768
"Digital Dogs Playing Poker."

00:01:09.768 --> 00:01:13.506
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:16.108
Next up we have, fact,
you can pay for NFTs

00:01:16.108 --> 00:01:18.210
with a variety
of cryptocurrencies.

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:21.447
Fiction, you can also
pay for NFTs with Kohl's Cash.

00:01:21.447 --> 00:01:23.582
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:23.582 --> 00:01:24.883
That's not true.
That's not true.

00:01:24.883 --> 00:01:26.085
-I think that is true.

00:01:26.085 --> 00:01:28.922
-And finally, fact,
digital artist Nurple

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:31.558
auctioned his masterpiece
"The Wizard's Tango"

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:35.695
for a whopping $3 million
worth of Trashcoin.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:38.231
Also fact, we made up
that entire last sentence.

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:40.934
That's all the time we have
for "Fact Versus Fiction."

